"<CLT>"

#. <CLT 4>戦刃むくろの致命傷…
#. 考えられるのって、あの傷しかないよな…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0011 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can only think of one thing that could have killed\n"
"her...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>ナイフの傷は偽装工作…それに全身の傷は、
#. ここ最近のものじゃなかったはずだ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0012 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>The knife was a cover-up, and all those other wounds\n"
"on her body weren't fresh.\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>だとすると、可能性があるのって…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0013 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>Which only leaves...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
